<title>USA: Omaha cattle fully steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha cattle fully steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said slaughter steers and heifers were active, prices were fully steady with last Tuesday.</p>
<p>Overall quality both steers and heifers much improved from previous sales.</p>
<p>Steers - choice 2-4 1150-1300 lbs 67.00-68.00, package 68.25. Select and choice 2-3 1100-1250 lbs 66.00-67.50.</p>
<p>Heifers - choice 2-4 1050-1200 lbs 66.50-68.00. Select and choice 2-3 1000-1150 lbs 66.00-67.50.</p>
</text>
